<page type="text" lines="ocr">
  <layout>One block of verse in a single column, with a running head at the top; a marginal note "Phi..." at the lower right margin edge; a small mark at the right margin.</layout>
  <page_number />
  <running_head>THEOD. BEZÆ</running_head>
  <bottom_margin>
  </bottom_margin>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1" para="true">
      <i>Perderet:fauí neque tunc Tyranni</i>
    </l>
    <l n="2">
      <i>Infolens nobis nocuit libido.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="3">
      <i>Sed tuos horrens monitus,minásque,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="4">
      <i>Hospites iußit remeare ad arua,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="5">
      <i>Qua bonus spondes,seniente tandem</i>
    </l>
    <l n="6">
      <i>Seculo,nostra soboli daturum.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="7">
      <i>Vicimus reges,duce te,superbos,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="8">
      <i>Et graues captæ spolijs Sodoma</i>
    </l>
    <l n="9">
      <i>Ditibus turmas:cuneosque forti</i>
    </l>
    <l n="10">
      <i>Marte deuictos,salidis Damasci</i>
    </l>
    <l n="11">
      <i>Non procul muris,saturare sedos</i>
    </l>
    <l n="12">
      <i>Vulturum sentres,Syriaque gentis</i>
    </l>
    <l n="13">
      <i>Vidimus lati maculare fuso</i>
    </l>
    <l n="14">
      <i>Sanguine campos.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="15" para="true">
      <i>Hæc cuncta præstat mira benignitas</i>
    </l>
    <l n="16">
      <i>Parentis almi.Fœderis hic memor,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="17">
      <i>Veráxque semper,postgenitis dabit</i>
    </l>
    <l n="18">
      <i>Promissa nostris regna.Nefaria</i>
    </l>
    <l n="19">
      <i>Non gentis ardor,nec rabies furens:</i>
    </l>
    <l n="20">
      <i>Nec quidquid audax improbitas mouet</i>
    </l>
    <l n="21">
      <i>Decreta regis sertet Olympici:</i>
    </l>
    <l n="22">
      <i>Hæc firma cunctis temporibus manent.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="23">
      <i>At tu profanum sulgus,&amp; impia</i>
    </l>
    <l n="24">
      <i>Timete gentes,tetra quibus tegit</i>
    </l>
    <l n="25">
      <i>Caligo mentem:Cœlitum &amp; infcius</i>
    </l>
    <l n="26">
      <i>Error nefandis incitat hostias</i>
    </l>
    <l n="27">
      <i>Offerre Diuis,mortiferum &amp; scelus</i>
    </l>
    <l n="28">
      <i>Audere quoduis,fœdaque crimina.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="29">
      <i>Nam summus orbem qui regit arbiter</i>
    </l>
  </main_text>
  <marginalia>
    <note side="right" at="Nam summus orbem" line_from="29" line_to="29">Phi</note>
  </marginalia>
  <notes>Marginal note at lower right is cut off ("Phi..."). Long s rendered as plain s; the scan's s and f forms are kept as printed in italic type. Some letters in the scan are doubtful (e.g. "Salidis", "Vidimus lati").</notes>
